      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": true,
      "content": "@everyone \uD83D\uDCE2 Update Time!\n\nThis update includes several improvements to the KLayout DRC deck and a new standard cell library!\n\n- PDK [`792ef670`](https://github.com/fossi-foundation/open-pdks/commit/792ef67037d74c8c51811eab3ce23cf793491296)\n  - KLayout DRC\n    - Add [DCF.1a](https://gf180mcu-pdk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/physical_verification/design_manual/drm_13_1.html)\n    - Fix [DF.11](https://gf180mcu-pdk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/physical_verification/design_manual/drm_07_06.html)\n    - Improve [CO.5a/b](https://gf180mcu-pdk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/physical_verification/design_manual/drm_07_13.html)\n  - KLayout LVS\n    -  Fix LDMOS extraction\n  - KLayout filler generation\n    - Consider DCF.1a properly\n  - Update `gf180mcu_as_sc_mcu7t3v3` to latest\n    - This adds a number of new standard cells, which can improve the maximum frequency of your design. Note: this SCL has not been fully silicon verified yet.\n  - Add `gf180mcu_ocd_sc_rt12t3v3`\n    - A radiation-tolerant standard cell library by @Tim Edwards!\n\n- Project Template [1.6.0](https://github.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-project-template/releases/tag/1.6.0)\n  - Update PDK to `792ef670`\n  - Update LibreLane\n  - Add `gf180mcu_ocd_sc_rt12t3v3` as an SCL option. Note: this SCL has not been silicon verified yet.\n  - Update the information about IP libraries in the README. Thanks @RebelMike for the inspiration!\n\n- Precheck [1.7.4](https://github.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-precheck/releases/tag/1.7.4)\n  - Update PDK to `792ef670`\n  - Update LibreLane\n\nPlease update your projects to the latest project template to ensure a smooth tapeout experience.\n\nIf you have any questions, please let me know.",
